nts.</li>\n  <li><strong>Achievement & Progression Loop:</strong> Throughout the continuous internal gameplay loop, the application's backend secretly monitors your sequence-building efficiency to constantly trigger special unlockable content. Consistently winning difficult offline matches steadily grants you permanent access to exclusive luxury avatars, advanced opponent difficulty profiles, and stunning new visual tabletop themes to keep you fully engaged over the long term.</li>\n</ul>",
